    Data minimization:
        LLM ko unnecessary data nahi dena chahiye.
    Retrieved documents ko untrusted data treat karo:
    Tool security:
      Ye agentic systems mein aur important ho jata hai.
      Suppose agent ke paas tools hain:   5-10
      LLM tool call generate kar sakta hai:
      Application ko blindly execute nahi karna chahiye.
      this should be flow
          LLM requests delete_order
              ↓
